    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Castleshane is an exceptional 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom detached home extending to approximately 142 sq m (1,528 sq ft), combining elegant red brick architecture with refined limestone detailing and thoughtfully planned interiors designed for modern family living.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, complete with peninsula kitchen units and casual seating—creating a natural hub for cooking, dining, and entertaining. French doors open directly onto the garden, enhancing the sense of light and flow. A separate utility room, dedicated storage, and a conveniently located WC add everyday practicality, while a generous front-facing living room offers a more private space for relaxation or entertaining.\r\nUpstairs, the home is arranged around a central landing and offers four well-proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite and a dedicated closet, while a second bedroom also enjoys its own en-suite, ideal for guests or older family members. Two additional bedrooms are served by a contemporary family bathroom, providing flexibility for growing families, home working, or hobby spaces.\r\nCarefully considered layouts maximise natural light and privacy throughout, with every space designed to feel both functional and welcoming. Set within a beautifully landscaped development of tree-lined avenues and green open spaces, The Castleshane delivers a perfect balance of architectural quality, modern comfort, and connected community living."
      },
      {
